<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="breadcrumbs">
  <ul>
    <li><.link navigate={~p"/"}>{gettext("Home")}</.link></li>
    <li class="is-active"><.link navigate={~p"/settings"}>{gettext("Settings")}</.link></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<.form
  :let={f}
  for={@global_settings.changeset}
  id="map_settings"
  as={:global_settings}
  phx-change="change"
>
  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="title is-4">地图</h2>
      <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          <%= label(f, :tencent_map_enabled, "地图", class: "label") %>
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="select is-fullwidth">
                <%= select(
                  f,
                  :tencent_map_enabled,
                  [
                    {"腾讯地图", true},
                    {"高德地图", false}
                  ],
                  id: "global_settings_tencent_map_enabled"
                ) %>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger"><%= error_tag(f, :tencent_map_enabled) %></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</.form>

<%= if Enum.count(@car_settings) > 0 do %>
  <%= if Enum.count(@car_settings) > 1 do %>
    <div class="tabs is-centered is-boxed">
      <ul>
        <%= for {car_id, %{original: %{car: car}}} <- @car_settings do %>
          <li class={if car_id == @car, do: "is-active"}>
            {link(car.name || "???", to: "#", phx_click: "car", phx_value_id: car_id)}
          </li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <.form
    :let={f}
    for={elem(List.keyfind(@car_settings, @car, 0), 1).changeset}
    id={"car_settings_#{@car}"}
    phx-change="change"
    as={:"car_settings_#{@car}"}
  >
    <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
      <div class="column">
        <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Data Collection")}</h2>
        <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
          <div class="field-label is-normal is-paddingless">
            {label(f, :enabled, gettext("Enabled"), class: "label")}
          </div>
          <div class="field-body">
            <div class="field">
              <div class="control">
                {checkbox(f, :enabled, class: "switch is-rounded is-success")}
                {label(f, :enabled, nil)}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
      <div class="column">
        <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Sleep Mode")}</h2>

        <%= unless Ecto.Changeset.get_field(f.source, :use_streaming_api) do %>
          <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
            <div class="field-label is-normal">
              {label(f, :suspend_min, gettext("Time to Try Sleeping"), class: "label")}
            </div>
            <div class="field-body">
              <div class="field">
                <div class="control">
                  <div class="select is-fullwidth">
                    {select(
                      f,
                      :suspend_min,
                      (Enum.filter(12..30, &(rem(&1, 3) == 0)) ++
                         Enum.filter(35..90, &(rem(&1, 5) == 0)))
                      |> Enum.map(&{"#{&1} #{gettext("min")}", &1})
                    )}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :suspend_min)}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
            <div class="field-label is-normal">
              {label(f, :suspend_after_idle_min, gettext("Idle Time Before Trying to Sleep"),
                class: "label"
              )}
            </div>
            <div class="field-body">
              <div class="field">
                <div class="control">
                  <div class="select is-fullwidth">
                    {select(
                      f,
                      :suspend_after_idle_min,
                      3..60
                      |> Enum.filter(&(&1 == 3 or rem(&1, 5) == 0))
                      |> Enum.map(&{"#{&1} #{gettext("min")}", &1})
                    )}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :suspend_after_idle_min)}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% end %>

        <div class="field is-horizontal mb-0">
          <div class="field-label is-normal is-paddingless">
            <label class="label">{gettext("Requirements")}</label>
          </div>
          <div class="field-body">
            <div class="field" style="min-width: 280px;">
              <div class="control">
                <div class="columns is-multiline is-mobile is-gapless">
                  <div class="column is-full">
                    <label class="checkbox">
                      {checkbox(f, :req_not_unlocked)}&nbsp; {gettext("Vehicle must be locked")}
                    </label>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
      <div class="column">
        <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Charge cost")}</h2>
        <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
          <div class="field-label is-normal is-paddingless">
            {label(f, :free_supercharging, gettext("Free Supercharging"), class: "label")}
          </div>
          <div class="field-body">
            <div class="field">
              <div class="control">
                {checkbox(f, :free_supercharging, class: "switch is-rounded is-success")}
                {label(f, :free_supercharging, nil)}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
      <div class="column">
        <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Streaming API")}</h2>
        <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
          <div class="field-label is-normal is-paddingless">
            {label(f, :use_streaming_api, gettext("Enabled"), class: "label")}
          </div>
          <div class="field-body">
            <div class="field">
              <div class="control">
                {checkbox(f, :use_streaming_api, class: "switch is-rounded is-success")}
                {label(f, :use_streaming_api, nil)}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
      <div class="column">
        <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Battery")}</h2>
        <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
          <div class="field-label is-normal is-paddingless">
            {label(f, :lfp_battery, gettext("LFP Battery"), class: "label")}
          </div>
          <div class="field-body">
            <div class="field">
              <div class="control">
                {checkbox(f, :lfp_battery, class: "switch is-rounded is-success")}
                {label(f, :lfp_battery, nil)}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </.form>
<% end %>

<div class={["divider", if(Enum.count(@car_settings) <= 1, do: " is-invisible")]}>
  {gettext("General Settings")}
</div>

<%= if Enum.count(@car_settings) > 1 do %>
  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Car Order")}</h2>
      <%= for {{car_id, %{original: %{car: car}}}, index} <- Enum.with_index(@car_settings) do %>
        <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically car-order-row">
          <div class="field-label is-normal is-paddingless">
            <label class="label">{car.name || "???"}</label>
          </div>
          <div class="field-body">
            <div class="field is-grouped">
              <div class="control">
                <button
                  id={"move-car-#{car_id}-up"}
                  class="button is-small"
                  type="button"
                  phx-click="move_car"
                  phx-value-id={car_id}
                  phx-value-direction="up"
                  disabled={index == 0}
                  aria-label={gettext("Move up")}
                >
                  <span class="icon is-small"><span class="mdi mdi-arrow-up"></span></span>
                </button>
              </div>
              <div class="control">
                <button
                  id={"move-car-#{car_id}-down"}
                  class="button is-small"
                  type="button"
                  phx-click="move_car"
                  phx-value-id={car_id}
                  phx-value-direction="down"
                  disabled={index == length(@car_settings) - 1}
                  aria-label={gettext("Move down")}
                >
                  <span class="icon is-small"><span class="mdi mdi-arrow-down"></span></span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>

<%= if TeslaMate.Api.signed_in?() and not TeslaMate.Import.enabled?() do %>
  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Vehicles")}</h2>
      <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
        <div class="field-label is-normal is-paddingless">
          <label
            class="label has-tooltip-multiline"
            data-tooltip={
              gettext(
                "Fetches the vehicle list from your Tesla account once and starts logging for vehicles that are not logged yet. Running loggers are not interrupted."
              )
            }
          >
            {gettext("Vehicle list")}<span class="icon is-small">&nbsp;<span class="mdi mdi-information"></span></span>
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <button
                id="reload-vehicles"
                type="button"
                class={["button is-small is-rounded", if(@reloading_vehicles?, do: "is-loading")]}
                disabled={@reloading_vehicles?}
                phx-click="reload_vehicles"
              >
                <span class="icon is-small"><span class="mdi mdi-reload"></span></span>
                <span>{gettext("Reload vehicles")}</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <p :if={@vehicle_reload} class="help">{@vehicle_reload}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>

<.form :let={f} for={@global_settings.changeset} id="global_settings" phx-change="change">
  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Range")}</h2>
      <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          <%= label f, :preferred_range, class: "label has-tooltip-multiline", data_tooltip: gettext("The car's estimate of remaining range is based on a fixed energy consumption in Wh/km. The Wh/km factor is determined by Tesla and is not country specific whereas the rated range is based on regulatory tests in the different markets for that vehicle.")  do %>
            {gettext("Preferred Range")}<span class="icon is-small">&nbsp;<span class="mdi mdi-information"></span></span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="select is-fullwidth">
                {select(f, :preferred_range, [
                  {gettext("ideal"), :ideal},
                  {gettext("rated"), :rated}
                ])}
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :preferred_range)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Language")}</h2>

      <div class="field is-horizontal">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          {label(f, :ui, gettext("Web App"), class: "label")}
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="select is-fullwidth">
                {select(f, :ui, supported_ui_languages(), selected: @locale)}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field is-horizontal">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          {label(f, :language, gettext("Addresses"), class: "label")}
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <div class={["select", "is-fullwidth", if(@refreshing_addresses?, do: "is-loading")]}>
                {select(f, :language, GlobalSettings.supported_languages(),
                  disabled: !@addresses_migrated? or @refreshing_addresses?
                )}
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger">{@refresh_error || error_tag(f, :language)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Theme")}</h2>
      <div class="field is-horizontal">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          {label(f, :theme_mode, gettext("Appearance"), class: "label")}
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="select is-fullwidth" id="theme-selector" phx-hook="ThemeSelector">
                {select(f, :theme_mode, [
                  {gettext("Light"), :light},
                  {gettext("Follow System"), :system},
                  {gettext("Dark"), :dark}
                ])}
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :theme_mode)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("Units")}</h2>
      <div class="field is-horizontal">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          {label(f, :unit_of_length, gettext("Length"), class: "label")}
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="select is-fullwidth">
                {select(f, :unit_of_length, [:km, :mi])}
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :unit_of_length)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field is-horizontal">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          {label(f, :unit_of_temperature, gettext("Temperature"), class: "label")}
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="select is-fullwidth">
                {select(f, :unit_of_temperature, "°C": :C, "°F": :F)}
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :unit_of_temperature)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field is-horizontal">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          {label(f, :unit_of_pressure, gettext("Tire Pressure"), class: "label")}
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              <div class="select is-fullwidth">
                {select(f, :unit_of_pressure, [:bar, :psi])}
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :unit_of_pressure)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column">
      <h2 class="title is-4">{gettext("URLs")}</h2>
      <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          {label(f, :base_url, gettext("Web App"), class: "label")}
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              {text_input(f, :base_url,
                type: :url,
                class: "input",
                phx_debounce: "blur",
                placeholder: "teslamate.example.com"
              )}
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :base_url)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field is-horizontal center-vertically">
        <div class="field-label is-normal">
          {label(f, :grafana_url, gettext("Dashboards"), class: "label")}
        </div>
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field">
            <div class="control">
              {text_input(f, :grafana_url,
                type: :url,
                class: "input",
                phx_debounce: "blur",
                placeholder: "grafana.example.com"
              )}
            </div>
            <p class="help is-danger">{error_tag(f, :grafana_url)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</.form>

<div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
  <div class="column is-narrow table-container">
    <table class="about table is-narrow">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th align="right">{gettext("Version")}</th>
          <td>
            {Application.spec(:teslamate, :vsn)}
            <button
              id="show-release-notes"
              type="button"
              class="button is-text is-small ml-2"
              phx-click="show_release_notes"
              aria-haspopup="dialog"
              aria-controls="release-notes-modal"
            >更新说明</button>
            <strong>{if @update do
              vsn =
                link(@update,
                  to: "https://github.com/teslamate-org/teslamate/releases",
                  target: "_blank",
                  rel: "noopener noreferrer"
                )

              [" (", gettext("Update available"), ": ", vsn, ")"]
            end}</strong>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th align="right">{gettext("GitHub")}</th>
          <td>
            {link("teslamate-org/teslamate",
              to: "https://github.com/teslamate-org/teslamate",
              target: "_blank",
              rel: "noopener noreferrer"
            )}
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th align="right">{gettext("Documentation")}</th>
          <td>
            {link("docs.teslamate.org",
              to: "https://docs.teslamate.org",
              target: "_blank",
              rel: "noopener noreferrer"
            )}
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<%= if TeslaMate.Api.signed_in?() and not TeslaMate.Import.enabled?() do %>
  <div class="columns is-mobile is-centered">
    <div class="column is-narrow table-container">
      <button class="button is-text is-rounded" aria-label="sign out" phx-click="sign_out">
        {gettext("Sign out")}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>

<div
  id="release-notes-modal"
  class={["modal modal-fade-scale", if(@show_release_notes, do: "is-active")]}
  phx-hook="Modal"
>
  <div class="modal-background" phx-click="close_release_notes" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <.focus_wrap
    :if={@show_release_notes}
    id="release-notes-dialog"
    class="modal-card"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="release-notes-title"
    phx-window-keydown="close_release_notes"
    phx-key="Escape"
  >
    <header class="modal-card-head">
      <h2 id="release-notes-title" class="modal-card-title is-size-5">更新说明</h2>
      <button
        id="close-release-notes"
        type="button"
        class="button is-text is-small"
        aria-label="关闭更新说明"
        phx-click="close_release_notes"
      ><span class="icon"><i class="mdi mdi-close" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></button>
    </header>
    <section class="modal-card-body release-notes-body">
      <h3 class="is-size-5">TeslaMate v4.3.0</h3>
      <p>本次从官方 v4.3.0 重新接入中文定制。以下为相对 v4.2.0 的主要更新。</p>

      <h4 class="is-size-6">车辆记录与稳定性</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>修复取消车辆软件更新时记录进程崩溃、更新记录无法结束的问题。</li>
        <li>修复车辆从休眠或离线恢复后，旧时间戳导致记录进程反复崩溃、状态卡住的问题。</li>
        <li>修复驾驶、充电或更新结束后，状态开始时间倒退的问题。</li>
        <li>重构车辆状态机，并增加 API 数据回放测试，检查数据库记录、MQTT 消息及连接行为。</li>
      </ul>

      <h4 class="is-size-6">设置与页面</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>设置页可调整车辆显示顺序。</li>
        <li>Tesla 账号新增车辆后，可点击“重新加载车辆”开始记录，无须重启。</li>
        <li>改善 Safari 地图渲染、手机上的 VIN 提示及 Grafana 返回导航。</li>
        <li>补齐主题、外观、车辆列表、排序及重新加载提示的简体中文。</li>
      </ul>

      <h4 class="is-size-6">登录与 Home Assistant</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>刷新令牌不再跟随重定向，避免将令牌发送到其他主机；进一步防止日志输出凭据。</li>
        <li>登录和令牌刷新失败时显示更准确的错误原因。</li>
        <li>Home Assistant MQTT 自动发现不再每次重启都重复迁移，减少实体被短暂删除、重建的问题。</li>
      </ul>

      <h4 class="is-size-6">本版本保留的定制</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>保留腾讯／高德地图切换，复用原有设置；历史地图 key 数据保持不变。</li>
        <li>保留国内坐标转换、围栏编辑、拖动缩放、全屏及两种地图统一的方向图标。</li>
        <li>修复腾讯地图退出全屏后回到旧位置的问题，并完善地图销毁清理。</li>
        <li>地址查询继续使用 address.wemate.top 中转服务，采用官方新版地址解析规则。</li>
        <li>保留车辆配置、充电、空调、胎压时间和媒体状态等扩展字段及 MQTT 输出。</li>
      </ul>

      <h4 class="is-size-6">Grafana 与内部调整</h4>
      <p>本版本保留原有中文 Grafana。官方 v4.3.0 的 Grafana 13.2.2、历史温度仪表盘及统计改动未包含在本次更新中。</p>
      <p>主程序已迁入 elixir/ 目录，构建与检查流程同步适配。官方新增 Rust 项目骨架，但本版本主程序仍使用 Elixir。</p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/teslamate-org/teslamate/releases/tag/v4.3.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看官方完整更新记录</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </.focus_wrap>
</div>
